          "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
          "sourceContextAndLimits": "Original SN2025 cover/effect dates and physical16/printed4 distinguish course lists. Physical59/printed47 continues LK12;60/printed48 Wahlbereich1 Farbstoffe belongs to LK12, with chromophore/donor-acceptor, indicator structure, dyeing experiments (vat as example), history/application and problem positioning. GK12 has no Farbstoffe option in its list: the already authored GK reflection/research targets are a declared own extension, not the LK elective silently relabelled GK.",
          "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Whole economic P: supplied synthetic output/price/research/archive models; scale-up/knowledge transfer, causal confounders, percentage versus total revenue and missing environmental costs. No real firm archive or universal single-cause history is asserted. The separate requires proposal retains all this performance.",
