          "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
          "sourceContextAndLimits": "Original ST2022 physical/printed44 (gAN) and54 (eAN) cover organic structure/property reasoning, independently evaluating selected societal/industry relationships and real investigations;51-52 (eAN) give redox/electron concepts. The complete PDF contains no named upper-secondary dye topic block. The listed already authored dye targets are therefore an explicit own application extension. These general contexts are not exact source coverage or an official dye/health/vat/history requirement.",
